# Introduction

Welcome! This documentation is authored in Markdown/MDX under `content/docs` and
compiled to React by Pola's Go-native pipeline — no Node.js at build or runtime.

> [!NOTE]
> Edit `content/docs/index.mdx` to change this page, and control the sidebar order
> with `content/docs/meta.json`.

